      "title": "Caught or cot?",
      "body": "The new vowels have close neighbours, and hearing the difference is what makes them stick. Long 𐑷 against short 𐑪 — 𐑒𐑷𐑑 is caught, 𐑒𐑪𐑑 is cot. 𐑷 against r-coloured 𐑹 — 𐑕𐑷 is saw, 𐑕𐑹 is sore. And sliding 𐑬 against steady 𐑴 — 𐑯𐑬 is now, 𐑯𐑴 is no."
    },
